==============================================================================
STEP 0b -- NORMALIZATION / PREPROCESSING (matched to Section 1.1)
==============================================================================
Section 1.1 (1_wesad/classical/wesad_classical_rerun.py, Task 1, "SEM SMOTE" table = the chapter's Table 1.1) uses, per LOSO fold:
  StandardScaler().fit_transform(X_train) -> SimpleImputer(strategy="mean").fit_transform(...)
  then the SAME fitted scaler+imputer .transform()-ed onto X_test. No SMOTE.
This script uses the identical per-fold fit-on-train-only StandardScaler + SimpleImputer(mean) protocol, no SMOTE, for every one of the 7 models below.

